@@ -89,7 +89,7 @@ If a PodVM crashes or is force-deleted, its data disks may remain in
 ## Volume Store Recovery
 
 The CSI driver persists volume metadata as JSON files under
-`/var/lib/caa-csi-block/volumes/` (hostPath). Controller operations such as
+`/var/lib/caa-csi-block/volumes/` (controller state PVC). Controller operations such as
